      "role": "user",
      "content": "I need a quick rundown on the internal safety correspondence from 2022 thru 2023. Specifically, look for anything where the client or their execs might have admitted they knew about product defects before the recall happened. We need to know exactly how bad our position is on this. Summarize the key points for me.",
